@api = http://localhost:5000

### List all apps (compose stacks + standalone containers)
GET {{api}}/api/apps

### Start an app
POST {{api}}/api/apps/my-stack/start

### Stop an app
POST {{api}}/api/apps/my-stack/stop

### Restart an app
POST {{api}}/api/apps/my-stack/restart

### Health
GET {{api}}/health/live
GET {{api}}/health/ready
